"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[93851],{93851:function(t){t.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n  cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/4edb2e8ccaa81c7097e4daf943ff0374.jpg\\"\\n  title=\\"Pasta La Vita\\"\\n  cuisine=\\"Italian\\"\\n  address=\\"13, Dongtansunhwan-daero 2-gil, Dongtan-gu, Hwaseong-si, Gyeonggi-do\\"\\n  rating=4.5\\n  tags=\\"restaurant\\"\\n/>\\n</center>\\n\\n## Ordered\\n\\n```menu\\n{\\n\\"title\\": \\"Red Shrimp Bisque Oil Pasta\\",\\n\\"rating\\": 4.5\\n}\\n---\\nAn oil pasta full of shrimp meat, where the bisque sauce made with shrimp innards and oil blend well together.\\n```\\n```menu\\n{\\n\\"title\\": \\"Neapolitan Tomato Pasta\\",\\n\\"rating\\": 4.0\\n}\\n---\\nA pasta with a subtle tomato flavor that is less stimulating than expected.\\n```\\n```menu\\n{\\n\\"title\\": \\"Jerusalem Artichoke Soup\\",\\n\\"rating\\": 4.0\\n}\\n---\\nThe subtle flavor of Jerusalem artichoke goes well with the cheese.\\n```\\n## Review\\nI wanted to eat pasta after a long time, so I searched for nearby restaurants and visited a place that had good reviews and was said to be delicious, even though it was located in an apartment shopping center.  \\n\\nI drove there, but there was no separate parking lot in the shopping center.  \\nIf you visit by car, it would be better to park nearby and walk.  \\n\\nThis is a one-person restaurant where the owner cooks and serves alone.  \\nBecause of this, there aren\'t many seats, but it is very popular, so it would be a good idea to make a reservation before visiting.  \\nFortunately, when we went, there was one two-person table left, so we were able to enter immediately without waiting.  \\nThe customers who came after us had to wait.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\nYou can place your order through the `kiosk`.  \\nWe ordered the `Red Shrimp Bisque Oil Pasta` and `Neapolitan Tomato Pasta`, which were marked as popular orders, and we also ordered `Jerusalem Artichoke Soup` as an appetizer.  \\n\\nSince the owner cooks alone, it naturally takes a long time after ordering.  \\nKnowing this beforehand, the waiting time wasn\'t that boring.  \\n\\nNot long after, the `Jerusalem Artichoke Soup` came out first.  \\nIt was a delicious potato soup with a subtle cheese flavor.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\nAfterwards, the two pastas came out at the same time.  \\nBoth were very delicious, but the <mark>Red Shrimp Bisque Oil Pasta</mark> was exceptionally good.  \\nThe bisque sauce, which included shrimp innards, blended so well with the oil, making it highly enjoyable.  \\nPersonally, it made me want to try making this bisque sauce at home.  \\nThe shrimp was also fleshy and delicious.  \\n\\nI would like to try other pasta dishes next time I visit.  \\nIf you want to have delicious pasta, I highly recommend it.\\n\\n## Pictures\\n\\n<pictures>\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/5980c76a36c2d928c6f532396c055315.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Pasta La Vita\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/954b285c8cee21fdf86a7d1eeb65781e.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Pasta La Vita\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/a0edaeb7995cd2aa2780035dc78f4a5a.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Pasta La Vita\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/346a31f93539e9cb6d295e0389d032a9.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Pasta La Vita\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/4edb2e8ccaa81c7097e4daf943ff0374.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Pasta La Vita\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/e054a13c59b784c92d76758e02104b41.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Pasta La Vita\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/406fb75623c1567994f35bfd8b3d8d9c.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Pasta La Vita\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/8039f81c60b7ab4eff81ba33df7dc0f1.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Pasta La Vita\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/dfe3a30e09fef3ad4d10872c83ed4071.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Pasta La Vita\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/4987966cf24212de2c5934049b3116ac.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Pasta La Vita\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/2c77a18abf78b101bae25736da3314d1.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Pasta La Vita\\">\\n</pictures>\\n"}')}}]);